	(text "Note: The power domain of this board is as follows:\n- +BATT: Power from the battery or barrel jack. Is only connected to the switch\n- VCC: Positive power after the switch, which is connected to the rest of the circuit\n- -BATT: Negative terminal of the battery, is connected to the rest of the circuit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
